Introduce ComponentAccumulator-style cluster reconstruction for ALLEGRO.

Introduce CreateCaloClustersConfig.py, which contains ComponentAccumulator-style
configuration functions for ALLEGRO cluster reconstruction.  Update configuration
scripts for ALLEGRO_o1_v03 and ALLEGRO_o2_v01 to use these functions.

This continues factoring out common configuration code to reduce
duplication.

This changes reconstruction results for o2_v01 because that configuration
did not include the cluster augmentation updates that were in o1_v03.
This change ensures that the configurations are consistent.
